	```haxe
	// button.png: a cell of 190 x 49 for each state, top down (normal, focused, pressed, disabled), borders of 14.
	LoadTextureAsync("assets/button.png", sheet -> GuiSetSkin(BUTTON, GUI_SKIN_BASE, GuiSkinFromSheet(sheet, 190, 49, 14, 14, 14, 14)));
	...
	if (GuiButton(new Rectangle(20, 20, 190, 49), "Play") != 0) ...
	```

	The parts each control draws:

	| control | `GUI_SKIN_BASE` | `GUI_SKIN_FILL` | `GUI_SKIN_HANDLE` | `GUI_SKIN_ITEM` |
	|---|---|---|---|---|
	| `DEFAULT` | `GuiPanel`'s, `GuiWindowBox`'s and `GuiScrollPanel`'s body | | | |
	| `BUTTON` | `GuiButton`, and `GuiSpinner`'s arrows | | | |
	| `TOGGLE` | a toggle, each of a toggle group's, a toggle slider's box | a toggle slider's selection | | |
	| `SLIDER` | the box | `GuiSliderBar`'s bar | `GuiSlider`'s handle | |
	| `PROGRESSBAR` | the box | the progress | | |
	| `CHECKBOX` | the box | the check | | |
	| `COMBOBOX`, `TEXTBOX`, `VALUEBOX`, `STATUSBAR` | the box | | | |
	| `DROPDOWNBOX` | the box | | | an open list's focused and chosen items |
	| `LISTVIEW` | the box | | | the focused and active items |
	| `SCROLLBAR` | the bar and its track | | the thumb | |

	A control draws its state's patch: `STATE_FOCUSED` with the pointer over it, `STATE_PRESSED` held down (and a toggle on),
	`STATE_DISABLED` between `GuiDisable` and `GuiEnable` or under `GuiSetState(STATE_DISABLED)`. A program that sets no skin links
